ss.<anonymous> (file:///home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-codex-frontera-base-r3/app/test/ayuda.ts:22:47)\n      at ChildProcess.wrapper (node:events:639:12)\n      at ChildProcess.emit (node:events:514:20)\n      at ChildProcess._handle.onexit (node:internal/child_process:323:12)\n\ntest at test/club.test.ts:52:1\n✖ la cabecera X-Socio identifica a quien llama (0.103746ms)\n  Error: La API terminó con código 1\n      at ChildProcess.<anonymous> (file:///home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-codex-frontera-base-r3/app/test/ayuda.ts:22:47)\n      at ChildProcess.wrapper (node:events:639:12)\n      at ChildProcess.emit (node:events:514:20)\n      at ChildProcess._handle.onexit (node:internal/child_process:323:12)\n\ntest at test/club.test.ts:59:1\n✖ el reloj del club se puede mover en las pruebas (0.138123ms)\n  Error: La API terminó con código 1\n      at ChildProcess.<anonymous> (file:///home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-codex-frontera-base-r3/app/test/ayuda.ts:22:47)\n      at ChildProcess.wrapper (node:events:639:12)\n      at ChildProcess.emit (node:events:514:20)\n      at ChildProcess._handle.onexit (node:internal/child_process:323:12)\n\ntest at test/club.test.ts:10:1\n✖ /home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-codex-frontera-base-r3/app/test/club.test.ts (0.163355ms)\n  TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'cerrar')\n      at TestContext.<anonymous> (file:///home/labseg/h/b-agents-md-codex-frontera-base-r3/app/test/club.test.ts:10:17)\n      at TestHook.runInAsyncScope (node:async_hooks:226:14)\n      at TestHook.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1402:25)\n      at TestHook.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1757:18)\n      at TestHook.run (node:internal/util:581:20)\n      at Test.runHook (node:internal/test_runner/test:1289:20)\n      at after (node:internal/test_runner/test:1342:20)\n      at Test.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1428:13)\n      at process.processTicksAndRejections (node:internal/process/task_queues:104:5)\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
